 * (platform.metix.ai, components/site/metix-logo.tsx), so the two sites put the
 * logo at the same size and in the same place. The wordmark takes currentColor;
 * the gradient keeps its published stops. Never retyped: brand.metix.ai forbids
 * rebuilding the wordmark in another font.
 */
